[[:db/retract 17592186407600 :answer-field/choices 17592186407587] [:db/retract 17592186407600 :answer-field/choices 17592186407595] [:db/retract 17592186407600 :answer-field/choices 17592186407581] [:db/retract 17592186407600 :answer-field/choices 17592186407582] {:db/id 17592186198259 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-76e33b5f-2848-5625-aa9f-8231d4a78a3e"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-76e33b5f-2848-5625-aa9f-8231d4a78a3e" :question/id #uuid "76e33b5f-2848-5625-aa9f-8231d4a78a3e" :question/math-academy-id "q-183322" :question/problem "![](images/8b/8b1286adb93e98a6d7b3ece98100c9ad6a51b39549a849ebfa382f2056d055bc.png)\n\nThe shaded regions above represent the truth sets of the predicates $P(x)$ and $Q(x),$ defined over the universal set ${R}^{2}.$ Which of the following is the truth set of $P(x)⇒Q(x)?$" :question/worked-solution "Since $P(x)⇒Q(x)≡¬P(x)∨Q(x),$ the corresponding truth sets can be found as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}_{P⇒Q} & ={T}_{¬P∨Q} \\\\  & ={T}_{¬P}\\cup {T}_{Q} \\\\  & ={\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\\cup {T}_{Q}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFirst, we sketch the set ${\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}:$ \n\n![](images/1e/1e308a124ef6367ff9c877098b76671ed0a40320edf634298a652f3ab187b40a.png)\n\n \n\nTherefore, to get the truth set of $¬P(x)∨Q(x),$ we take all the points that belong to ${\\overset{―}{T}}_{p}$ or ${T}_{Q}:$\n\n![](images/9b/9bf7e5e7c6ddd8ce5faa8e47529454865cfc41e6525de57a811c7dcf38e46154.png)\n\nAs a result, we get the following diagram:\n\n![](images/b4/b48fdc8f6de1d9cb599b0c9a149c3146f969717301a28d81cde083c3f36e80f3.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3babf3f9-8749-5017-9151-1806bc0ee134"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3babf3f9-8749-5017-9151-1806bc0ee134" :answer-field/id #uuid "3babf3f9-8749-5017-9151-1806bc0ee134" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-5b8fb81c-f738-513b-b6e8-81515e7964fe" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1aa15ca2-188b-592f-9ec5-2c451c97ea97" "answer-5b8fb81c-f738-513b-b6e8-81515e7964fe" "answer-2c03df23-ed39-5ec2-a8bf-76fe5b616882" "answer-76909537-22f5-5c34-9d34-9b605382d5cd" "answer-ec1168af-25d4-5b3c-ac8f-6a58dbfec11b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1aa15ca2-188b-592f-9ec5-2c451c97ea97" :answer/id #uuid "1aa15ca2-188b-592f-9ec5-2c451c97ea97" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/60/60c3e72ee4cda4b3c8143fe902323f82be3b7427352d7c870030e3e6f8da86b6.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5b8fb81c-f738-513b-b6e8-81515e7964fe" :answer/id #uuid "5b8fb81c-f738-513b-b6e8-81515e7964fe" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/b4/b48fdc8f6de1d9cb599b0c9a149c3146f969717301a28d81cde083c3f36e80f3.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2c03df23-ed39-5ec2-a8bf-76fe5b616882" :answer/id #uuid "2c03df23-ed39-5ec2-a8bf-76fe5b616882" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/c0/c0fcea21d82466c2e0d4a6aec071549d26aa841102cb21d34075705fc4afd089.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-76909537-22f5-5c34-9d34-9b605382d5cd" :answer/id #uuid "76909537-22f5-5c34-9d34-9b605382d5cd" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/cf/cf494d71eed8ccd8753905930f402227bee1fc37050c029233030f93fe776e0f.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ec1168af-25d4-5b3c-ac8f-6a58dbfec11b" :answer/id #uuid "ec1168af-25d4-5b3c-ac8f-6a58dbfec11b" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/ef/efe7aab996bd80d0566f0c2a3660684fca064c4f3d56501c20cd0ee26992fd00.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186198260 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-f764222e-7e7e-5e1f-8907-653f8f221162"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186407603 :question/problem "For the universal set $U,$ given by\n\n$$\nU=\\{5,10,15,20,25,30,35\\},\n$$\n\nfind the truth set of $P(x)⇔Q(x)$ for the following predicates: \n\n- $P(x):$ $x$ is odd.\n\n- $Q(x):$ $\\sqrt{x}$ is integer." :question/worked-solution "Since we have that\n\n$$\nP(x)⇔Q(x)≡(P(x)∧Q(x))∨(¬P(x)∧¬Q(x)),\n$$\n\nthe corresponding truth set can be found as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}_{P⇔Q}=({T}_{P}\\cap {T}_{Q})\\cup ({\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that:\n\n- The truth set of $P(x)$ is \n\n$$\n{T}_{P}=\\{5,15,25,35\\}\n$$\n\nand its complement is\n\n$$\n{\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}=\\{10,20,30\\}.\n$$\n\n- The truth set of $Q(x)$ is \n\n$$\n{T}_{Q}=\\{25\\}\n$$\n\n \nand its complement is\n\n$$\n{\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q}=\\{5,10,15,20,30,35\\}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}_{P}\\cap {T}_{Q} & =\\{5,15,25,35\\}\\cap \\{25\\} \\\\  & =\\{25\\} \\\\ {\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q} & =\\{10,20,30\\}\\cap \\{5,10,15,20,30,35\\} \\\\  & =\\{10,20,30\\} \\\\ {T}_{P⇔Q} & =({T}_{P}\\cap {T}_{Q})\\cup ({\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q}) \\\\  & =\\{25\\}\\cup \\{10,20,30\\} \\\\  & =\\{10,20,25,30\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186407600 :answer-field/correct "answer-618c6d16-a8d6-56f6-89a7-b0c885f2a8f8" :answer-field/choices ["answer-618c6d16-a8d6-56f6-89a7-b0c885f2a8f8" "answer-72135715-b39e-5cf0-b28b-2945d770d93e" "answer-c757ac5f-7fce-5299-918a-1f1f438db85f" "answer-75b72781-8ec0-5deb-8ffe-dd841156e69a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-618c6d16-a8d6-56f6-89a7-b0c885f2a8f8" :answer/id #uuid "618c6d16-a8d6-56f6-89a7-b0c885f2a8f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{10,20,25,30\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-72135715-b39e-5cf0-b28b-2945d770d93e" :answer/id #uuid "72135715-b39e-5cf0-b28b-2945d770d93e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{10,20,30\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c757ac5f-7fce-5299-918a-1f1f438db85f" :answer/id #uuid "c757ac5f-7fce-5299-918a-1f1f438db85f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{25\\}" :db/ensure 