dio :answer-field/correct "answer-b792645f-4b9f-5476-9315-a1ecaa09b9aa" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3207260e-3718-50d9-a4fa-8e520d1a83e1" "answer-b792645f-4b9f-5476-9315-a1ecaa09b9aa" "answer-a853838e-be12-5340-9563-7fa70132c602" "answer-a27da476-dc19-57e5-a5ba-3174f3d97771" "answer-157aefd8-264e-5416-a46c-58af9d46a84a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3207260e-3718-50d9-a4fa-8e520d1a83e1" :answer/id #uuid "3207260e-3718-50d9-a4fa-8e520d1a83e1" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/15/15f8aeac3f8f52aa24b2cb4b9d8a3473295b308b1d11de0343bdd9d17772b091.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b792645f-4b9f-5476-9315-a1ecaa09b9aa" :answer/id #uuid "b792645f-4b9f-5476-9315-a1ecaa09b9aa" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/3f/3ff8df9df6788053548ddcb092265ebb1af89f06512bb6052f0f7d8225e03c71.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a853838e-be12-5340-9563-7fa70132c602" :answer/id #uuid "a853838e-be12-5340-9563-7fa70132c602" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/5d/5d92cecb33c2a3495dd1ad4793dbfd4c102b340b500127f5523427c21592f7f5.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a27da476-dc19-57e5-a5ba-3174f3d97771" :answer/id #uuid "a27da476-dc19-57e5-a5ba-3174f3d97771" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/aa/aa7ffc62b5cc79f1f4dd1f7a039a0e0b9ca0ea97b0e6e9397bf607b0d1286003.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-157aefd8-264e-5416-a46c-58af9d46a84a" :answer/id #uuid "157aefd8-264e-5416-a46c-58af9d46a84a" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/f8/f8eb413800d379c1a03a2675e2b04c0f9ba5b54ad3711cfc108e3343fac9513a.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-bd4ff006-9ebf-5a4d-9116-4f5cd068a5ad" :question/id #uuid "bd4ff006-9ebf-5a4d-9116-4f5cd068a5ad" :question/math-academy-id "q-77616" :question/problem "![](images/dc/dc12a180a283b34a36d1f44d6ea197b017138632f1d1918255a1b4253b541fd0.png)\n\nConsider the triangle $△ABC$ shown above. The line segment $\\overset{―}{CH}$ is the altitude corresponding to $\\overset{―}{AB}.$ If $m∠BAC={120}^{∘},$ calculate $m∠HCA.$" :question/worked-solution "Since the straight angle must have a measure of ${180}^{∘},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠HAC+m∠BAC & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ m∠HAC+{120}^{∘} & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ m∠HAC & ={60}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that $△AHC$ is a right triangle. Since its interior angles must sum to ${180}^{∘},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠HCA+m∠HAC+m∠AHC & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ m∠HCA+{60}^{∘}+{90}^{∘} & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ m∠HCA+{150}^{∘} & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ m∠HCA & ={30}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-2cc12287-be31-553d-911e-bf2ff3aa5cd2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-2cc12287-be31-553d-911e-bf2ff3aa5cd2" :answer-field/id #uuid "2cc12287-be31-553d-911e-bf2ff3aa5cd2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a811a50d-2956-506e-b098-0bd862fe0b17" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ac4dfbc5-e90c-545e-ba5d-eddfa04b9910" "answer-5b711e67-6b4c-5419-a74e-8098d5c2e1ae" "answer-a811a50d-2956-506e-b098-0bd862fe0b17" "answer-647448d8-c56e-561c-a3d4-59317e57f4ba" "answer-11eec1e7-2a4c-55d1-a9dd-c469ce16e56c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ac4dfbc5-e90c-545e-ba5d-eddfa04b9910" :answer/id #uuid "ac4dfbc5-e90c-545e-ba5d-eddfa04b9910" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{25}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5b711e67-6b4c-5419-a74e-8098d5c2e1ae" :answer/id #uuid "5b711e67-6b4c-5419-a74e-8098d5c2e1ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{28}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a811a50d-2956-506e-b098-0bd862fe0b17" :answer/id #uuid "a811a50d-2956-506e-b098-0bd862fe0b17" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{30}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-647448d8-c56e-561c-a3d4-59317e57f4ba" :answer/id #uuid "647448d8-c56e-561c-a3d4-59317e57f4ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{35}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-11eec1e7-2a4c-55d1-a9dd-c469ce16e56c" :answer/id #uuid "11eec1e7-2a4c-55d1-a9dd-c469ce16e56c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{40}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186115491 :question/problem "![](images/d5/d53e300cf45128d4d0d3e06e9c4adc6ab966ff9493c399496d18a2e2bf634099.png)\n\nConsider $△PQR$ shown above. The line segment $\\overset{―}{RH}$ is the altitude corresponding to $\\overset{―}{PQ}.$ If $m∠PQR={105}^{∘},$ calculate $m∠QRH.$" :question/worked-solution "Since the straight angle must have a measure of ${180}^{∘},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠HQR+m∠PQR & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ m∠HQR+{105}^{∘} & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ m∠HQR & ={75}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that $△QHR$ is a right triangle. Since its interior angles must sum to ${180}^{∘},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠QRH+m∠HQR+m∠RHQ & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ m∠QRH+{75}^{∘}+{90}^{∘} & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ m∠QRH+{165}^{∘} & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ m∠QRH & ={15}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186111955 :answer-field/correct "answer-79c41c18-d6d7-5be7-98cb-1a1e095035c7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-23e0f71a-100d-5712-9d19-f322914fc1ec" "answer-08dd57a7-504c-5de0-acd7-cc0e4a08fc3a" "answer-79c41c18-d6d7-5be7-98cb-1a1e095035c7" "answer-514a2f2e-1cb0-5ca3-ba0b-33b33697aa9a" "answer-688f8c98-c680-51ae-8b8b-fbeefc267bad"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-23e0f71a-100d-5712-9d19-f322914fc1ec" :answer/id #uuid "23e0f71a-100d-5712-9d19-f322914fc1ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{10}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-08dd57a7-504c-5de0-acd7-cc0e4a08fc3a" :answer/id #uuid "08dd57a7-504c-5de0-acd7-cc0e4a08fc3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{12}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-79c41c18-d6d7-5be7-98cb