er-field/choices ["answer-05d8f285-cdd2-55af-a3b6-2179b7742a38" "answer-b5a16136-9029-54ee-b815-5120584dc7cc" "answer-c36a078d-d1d6-54bb-86a8-b6657a466986" "answer-8166c34f-e359-5b5c-ba3e-efe8e59a3e11" "answer-f92e3af2-da17-50cc-b292-b5e912be09fe"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-05d8f285-cdd2-55af-a3b6-2179b7742a38" :answer/id #uuid "05d8f285-cdd2-55af-a3b6-2179b7742a38" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/50/5098abed199db997b901675210c7289f2a85732881a1defeadc2e5f2b80d8086.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b5a16136-9029-54ee-b815-5120584dc7cc" :answer/id #uuid "b5a16136-9029-54ee-b815-5120584dc7cc" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/95/95988c03055bed7c4cfc14331c76153a3e813d0d0a3018aa49b26494503fe856.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c36a078d-d1d6-54bb-86a8-b6657a466986" :answer/id #uuid "c36a078d-d1d6-54bb-86a8-b6657a466986" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/a0/a0038e238ec25cfc1dfe7d2f89712f58931fb48ecea2c8f4e07fe613a3257735.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8166c34f-e359-5b5c-ba3e-efe8e59a3e11" :answer/id #uuid "8166c34f-e359-5b5c-ba3e-efe8e59a3e11" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/a3/a33a645a435e8c144a1109f91850deff11bfd059724a7161753c9bb9a620a521.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f92e3af2-da17-50cc-b292-b5e912be09fe" :answer/id #uuid "f92e3af2-da17-50cc-b292-b5e912be09fe" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/e2/e2f5215e5c1aab95306d4ec5aee54ff1b8ccd01fbb08043678692722faa904ca.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-53afd0b5-618f-512e-b769-550096e6ab34" :question/id #uuid "53afd0b5-618f-512e-b769-550096e6ab34" :question/math-academy-id "q-61532" :question/problem "![](images/38/3887946edaafb7d94bbf911c53cf1a0d2a48d43880829ce6069cc42d26eba526.png)\n\nTimmy set up a one-day lemonade sale in front of his house.  The ratio of disposable cups to lemonade servings is given by the tape diagram above. If he had a total of $40$ disposable cups to begin with, how many lemonade servings did he have then?" :question/worked-solution "We are told that there were $40$ disposable cups in total. The tape diagram for those shows $5$ boxes. Therefore, each box in the diagram above represents $40÷5=8$ disposable cups.   \n\nNow, we fill the number $8$ in each box of both tapes:\n\n![](images/b3/b3ed4d72509ba29446f6da8919d81b4cce2dc57d6b80c8496f832c2ec5e95616.png)\n\nSince there are $6$ boxes corresponding to lemonade servings, and each box represents $8$ servings, the number of servings was:\n\n$$\n6\\times 8=48\n$$\n\nSo, Timmy had $48$ lemonade servings in total." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-37db5ec2-f9a8-5671-bc92-006c4e342a3f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-37db5ec2-f9a8-5671-bc92-006c4e342a3f" :answer-field/id #uuid "37db5ec2-f9a8-5671-bc92-006c4e342a3f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-0583df89-041e-5716-af95-ad0c9e34690a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-dd4afc5a-0150-5a11-9740-d784a47099cf" "answer-1817bc92-459c-5fcd-8cbb-98ffaa0ead78" "answer-0583df89-041e-5716-af95-ad0c9e34690a" "answer-c766dc2f-41ae-5381-a852-34b3054afd50" "answer-30524095-39a7-50b4-917d-049f5b85fd5e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dd4afc5a-0150-5a11-9740-d784a47099cf" :answer/id #uuid "dd4afc5a-0150-5a11-9740-d784a47099cf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1817bc92-459c-5fcd-8cbb-98ffaa0ead78" :answer/id #uuid "1817bc92-459c-5fcd-8cbb-98ffaa0ead78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "42" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0583df89-041e-5716-af95-ad0c9e34690a" :answer/id #uuid "0583df89-041e-5716-af95-ad0c9e34690a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "48" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c766dc2f-41ae-5381-a852-34b3054afd50" :answer/id #uuid "c766dc2f-41ae-5381-a852-34b3054afd50" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "54" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-30524095-39a7-50b4-917d-049f5b85fd5e" :answer/id #uuid "30524095-39a7-50b4-917d-049f5b85fd5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "56" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186074478 :question/worked-solution "We are told that there are $45$ stairs in the warehouse. The tape diagram for the stairs shows $5$ boxes. Therefore, each box in the diagram above represents $45÷5=9.$\n\nNow, we fill the number $9$ in each box of both tapes:\n\n![](images/db/db352d53c2926e7a42b8183088a35860f057f4e5a845554ada955303e3dc8926.png)\n\nSince there are $9$ boxes corresponding to the stairs and carts in total, and each box represents $9$ of these items, the total number of stairs and carts are:\n\n$$\n9\\times 9=81\n$$\n\nSo, there are $81$ stairs and carts altogether." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186073106 :answer-field/correct 17592186073109 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "question-c2d3a89a-3b53-50ea-ab1b-27e8bcd50832" :question/id #uuid "c2d3a89a-3b53-50ea-ab1b-27e8bcd50832" :question/math-academy-id "q-61523" :question/problem "![](images/03/03b73d8213a55e4a50885b80b8f031de3186e46d9b358be792c2043b1c8a97b8.png)\n\nThe tape diagram above shows the ratio between the number of liters of milk and juice that Bob buys in a month. If he buys $16$ liters of milk in a month, how many liters of milk and juice does he buy altogether?" :question/worked-solution "We are told that he buys $16$ liters of milk. The tape diagram for liters of milk shows $4$ boxes. Therefore, each box in the diagram above represents $16÷4=4$ liters.\n\nNow, we fill the number $4$ in each box of both tapes:\n\n![](images/c8/c896618aebed4174005a7d47059eb74e24bc762645b8a46303a07e643c293407.png)\n\nSince there are $6$ boxes corresponding to the liters of juice and milk in total, and each box represents $4$ liters, the total number of liters is:\n\n$$\n4\\times 6=24\n$$\n\nSo, he buys $24$ liters of milk and juice altogether." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-0594b8e2-931c-592c-8dc4-588f0e38cb85"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0594b8e2-931c-592c-8dc4-588f0e38cb85" :answer-field/id #uuid "0594b8e2-931c-592c-8dc4-588f0e38cb85" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-84ce9ec7-b9f1-5dbb-a76c-e72a04efe5a1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-354ac960-677f-551a-9ce9-2a96a291649a" "answer-7d7efe48-417e-5b36-85c8-80c25e17af61" "answer-d699150e-5a62-5ce4-8b68-529fd7c62a10" "answer-84ce9ec7-b9f1-5dbb-a76c-e72a04efe5a1" "answer-6e54e3f8-576d-588f-9143-88e8b89aa3e6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-354ac960-677f-551a-9ce9-2a96a291649a" :answer/id #uuid "354ac960-677f-551a-9ce9-2a96a291649a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "13" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7d7efe48-417e-5b36-85c8-80c25e17af61" :answer/id #uuid "7d7efe48-417e-5b36-85c8-80c25e17af61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "18" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d699150e-5a62-5ce4-8b68-529fd7c62a10" :answer/id #uuid "d699150e-5a62-5ce4-8b68-529fd7c62a10" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-84ce9ec7-b9f1-5dbb-a76c-e72a04efe5a1" :answer/id #uuid "84ce9ec7-b9f1-5dbb-a76c-e72a04efe5a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6e54e3f8-576d-588f-9143-88e8b89aa3e6" :answer/id #uuid "6e54e3f8-576d-588f-9143-88e8b89aa3e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "30" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-e4c72bae-b132-52e1-8c37-a59f0f9c3c2e" :question/id #uuid "e4c72bae-b132-52e1-8c37-a59f0f9c3c2e" :question/math-academy-id "q-61483" :question/problem "![](images/c0/c00fee9c5165bea605b349ee700e46c2e1898e7c6b65595c462207fd237d6e5a.png)\n\nSally made a necklace using cubic and spherical beads.  The ratio of cubic to spherical beads is given by the tape diagram above.  If there are $18$ spherical beads in the necklace, then how many cubic beads are there in total?" :question/worked-solution "We are told that there are $18$ spherical beads in total. The tape diagram for those shows $3$ boxes. Therefore, each box in the diagram above represents $18÷3=6$ beads.  \n\nNow, we fill the number $6$ in each box of both tapes:\n\n![](images/9b/9b7efbe8e98fe498afbed34ffa33f02248eb72bd3a16a8683a5c26daefda9505.png)\n\nSince there are $5$ boxes corresponding to cubic beads, and each box represents $6$ beads, the number of the cubic beads is:\n\n$$\n5\\times 6=30\n$$\n\nSo, there are $30$ cubic beads in the necklace." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-74f83c28-b548-59e6-b87c-e6a851d6f665"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-74f83c28-b548-59e6-b87c-e6a851d6f665" :answer-field/id #uuid "74f83c28-b548-59e6-b87c-e6a851d6f665" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b45c8010-7423-5107-8de6-af7542953589" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e5a306e4-43ea-574e-b69e-98ea30a29631" "answer-cafbf5e3-c8e3-593f-9419-ee534075deed" "answer-b45c8010-7423-5107-8de6-af7542953589" "answer-7fc9a1b6-9c7b-59e1-81b7-9c5aa639433e" "answer-ae83b0b4-4123-5cc1-9e33-357482fda453"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e5a306e4-43ea-574e-b69e-98ea30a29631" :answer/id #uuid "e5a306e4-43ea-574e-b69e-98ea30a29631" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cafbf5e3-c8e3-593f-9419-ee534075deed" :answer/id #uuid "cafbf5e3-c8e3-593f-9419-ee534075deed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id