presents $45÷5=9$ fish.\n\nNow, we fill the number $9$ in each box of both tapes:\n\n![](images/06/069481a1ab6b18ebe6bf20053b793c49b54c06352f3acfc218aae32e34cd8f50.png)\n\nSince there are $3$ boxes corresponding to guppies, and each box represents $9$ fish, the number of guppies must be:\n\n$$\n3\\times 9=27.\n$$\n\nSo, there are $27$ guppies in the aquarium." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-295eea8d-3042-5402-89d4-b8c01da0cfbc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-295eea8d-3042-5402-89d4-b8c01da0cfbc" :answer-field/id #uuid "295eea8d-3042-5402-89d4-b8c01da0cfbc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-783751a9-a432-53e9-8bd7-8a03d54a5882" :answer-field/choices ["answer-64f60689-b357-578d-8669-cd5699f8108e" "answer-783751a9-a432-53e9-8bd7-8a03d54a5882" "answer-1ef40008-17cc-5d46-9276-1a20bd40b1ac" "answer-dab43930-651b-58b0-8ae4-b9c37c9494a1" "answer-ef698e71-aced-5a26-a4cf-9c125a272cce"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-64f60689-b357-578d-8669-cd5699f8108e" :answer/id #uuid "64f60689-b357-578d-8669-cd5699f8108e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "18" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-783751a9-a432-53e9-8bd7-8a03d54a5882" :answer/id #uuid "783751a9-a432-53e9-8bd7-8a03d54a5882" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "27" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1ef40008-17cc-5d46-9276-1a20bd40b1ac" :answer/id #uuid "1ef40008-17cc-5d46-9276-1a20bd40b1ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "30" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dab43930-651b-58b0-8ae4-b9c37c9494a1" :answer/id #uuid "dab43930-651b-58b0-8ae4-b9c37c9494a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "45" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ef698e71-aced-5a26-a4cf-9c125a272cce" :answer/id #uuid "ef698e71-aced-5a26-a4cf-9c125a272cce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :